# Fix Client

One app, like Lunar Client / Badlion: open it, sign in with Microsoft, pick a Minecraft version, press LAUNCH.
- 1.8.9  -> Badlion-style features
- 1.9 and newer (up to the latest, 26.3) -> Lunar-style features
- Press Right Shift in the game to open the Fix menu. C = zoom.
- Java is installed automatically. There is also a Mods page (Modrinth search and install).

## Get the installer (.exe) without installing anything on your PC
1. Create a free account on github.com and a new repository.
2. Upload ALL files and folders of this project (also the hidden .github folder).
3. Open the "Actions" tab. Wait until the run finishes (some version jobs may be red, that is OK).
4. Open the finished run. At the bottom, download **Fix-Client-Installer**. Unzip it.
5. Inside is "Fix Client Setup 1.0.0.exe". Install it and give the same file to everyone.

## Folders
- app/            the Fix Client program (Electron). app/mods/index.json says which mod jar belongs to which Minecraft version.
- forge-1.8.9/    in-game mod for 1.8.9 (Forge)
- fabric-1.21/    in-game mod for 1.20 to 1.21.8 (Fabric). patches/ turns the 1.21 code into the 1.20 code
- fabric-26/      in-game mod for 26.1 to 26.3 (Fabric, Java 25) and 1.21.11 (patches/ converts it)

## Which versions have the in-game Fix menu
| Minecraft | Loader | Status |
|---|---|---|
| 1.8.9 | Forge | built now (Badlion-style) |
| 1.21 to 1.21.8 | Fabric | built now (Lunar-style) |
| 1.9 to 1.12.2 | Forge | next |
| 1.20 to 1.20.6 | Fabric | built now (Lunar-style, patched port, may need fixes) |
| 1.14 to 1.19.4 | Fabric | next (own code port) |
| 1.21.11 | Fabric | built now (converted from the 26 code, may need fixes) |
| 1.21.9 to 1.21.10 | Fabric | next |
| 26.1 to 26.3 | Fabric | built now (smaller feature set: FPS, CPS, Ping, Keystrokes, Coordinates, Server Address, Playtime, Clock, Memory, Toggle Sprint) |

Every version from 1.8.9 to the latest already shows in the version list and launches. Versions without a mod build yet start normally and get the Fix menu when their build is added.

## Features that work now
HUD: FPS, CPS, Ping, Keystrokes, Coordinates, Armor Status, Potion Status (1.8.9 only), Direction, Clock, Memory, Item Counter, Server Address, Playtime, Day Counter
PvP: Combo Counter, Reach Display, Hitboxes
Other: Zoom, Always Day, Toggle Sprint
